\newlabel{fig:euroc-svo-da3-sim3}{{2}{3}{EuRoC Sim(3) RMSE comparison across SVO mono, SVO mono+IMU, and DA3-LARGE through DA3-Streaming at 5~fps with 30-frame chunks, 15-frame overlap, and loop enabled. Unlike the TUM case, DA3 does not approach the visual-inertial SVO trajectory quality here and is generally worse than even monocular SVO. This is the main evidence that the DA3 prior advantage is regime-dependent rather than universal}{figure.2}{}}
